      "writtenOn": "2024-11-07T16:38:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, no. As @gurchetansingh@google.com made clear earlier, there are two problems right now --\n\nOlder guest, newer host: Currently broken, making the change in this MR to keep this as default ON would fix this.\nNewer guest, older host: Making the change in this MR would BREAK this.\n\nThe only way to do this properly is as Gurchetan said:\n\n\"\nSo we\u0027ll only have to change this MR to modify the name of the capset (disableVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate). We\u0027ll also need a guest side MR to modify the capset name, and do mFeatureInfo.hasVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate \u003d !mCaps.vulkanCapset. disableVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate;. That\u0027s essentially it.\n\"\n\nI will go ahead and make this change.",
      "parentUuid": "b0b3f9f5_3889aedf",
