      "writtenOn": "2024-11-07T17:02:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eNewer guest, older host: Making the change in this MR would BREAK this.\n\nHosts (even older ones) can already enable or disable the feature at startup. So you\u0027ll just need to ensure you specifically request `-feature VulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate` (or -feature -VulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate for disablement) which is why I am suggesting this should be an opt-in as opposed to an opt-out. This way the host knows to expect that the guest will process batches of descriptor sets.",
